I hate capitals, and would have forced first syllable stress using a
pseudo- vowel:  "turstan".  Of course, the way most people would
pronounce your name on seeing it, both syllables have a syllabic
consonant:  trstn.  With no explicit vowels, people would naturally fall
back to penultimate stress without marking it.

